#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:41
#: adbea3f3b97e43a8b85da267b6268828
msgid ""
"The SERIAL1 port has RTS/CTS pins, the other UARTs do not have RTS/CTS."
msgstr "SERIAL1 端口有 RTS/CTS 引脚，其他 UART 没有 RTS/CTS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:43
#: c2b2703eb8e146b2aa9fd6a46d6a2a4b
msgid ""
"The RCIN port can be used as RX or TX as a general UART using the "
"SERIAL4_OPTIONS bits to swap pins. It is not used for RC input (the PPM pin "
"is used for RC input)"
msgstr ""
"RCIN 端口可通过设置 SERIAL4_OPTIONS 位交换引脚，用作 RX 或 TX 通用 UART。它不用于 RC 输入（PPM 引脚用于 RC"
" 输入）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:47
#: 5e6acdd4e4ea4b618ba238e0f048d407
msgid ""
"The UART7 connector is inside the case and labelled as debug, but is "
"available as a general purpose UART with ArduPilot."
msgstr "UART7 连接器位于机壳内部，标记为调试，但在 ArduPilot 中可用作通用 UART。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:51
#: e9d25ab129e5409ea0fab22ddc387797
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:52
#: a06ce1f51b9a45db99fd5271f2f422f6
msgid ""
"The PPM pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for "
"all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which"
" require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"PPM 引脚默认映射到定时器输入，可用于除 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 之外的所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议（这两者需要真正的 "
"UART 连接）。但是，以这种方式连接时，FPort 只能提供 RC 而没有数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:54
#: f66038cd781e4ee0b24d8f37f4017807
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the RCIN port's RCIN pin can also be configured to be used as "
"true UART RX or TX pin for use with bi-directional systems by setting the "
"SERIAL4 parameters appropriately."
msgstr ""
"为支持 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的嵌入式数传，RCIN 端口的 RCIN 引脚也可配置为真正的 UART RX 或 TX "
"引脚用于双向系统，方法是适当设置 SERIAL4 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:56
#: 6f55d337f77b4019971df8a1901954ac
msgid ""
"To use RCIN for bi-directional RC and Telemetry protocols, "
":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` must be set to \"23\", and:"
msgstr ""
"要将 RCIN 用于双向 RC 和数传协议，:ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` 必须设置为 "
"「23」，并且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:58
#: a220561b679a44a793eba9449227d033
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:60
#: 57e436482a844ab6a26cb4bedc09123f
msgid ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RCIN pin, but SBUS requires that the "
":ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to \"3\" to invert the "
"signal."
msgstr ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 RCIN 引脚，但 SBUS 要求将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>`"
" 设置为 「3」 以反转信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:62
#: bab9fd25fc874515a242f8c765d09515
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to RCIN and "
":ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to \"15\"."
msgstr "FPort 需要连接到 RCIN，并将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「15」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:64
#: 8a2a31356bd84dee8a68a5ff78f961e2
msgid ""
"CRSF requires connection to both RX and TX of a UART, so the RCIN port and "
"pin cannot be used. Instead either SERIAL1 (UART2), SERIAL2 (UART4), or "
"SERIAL3 (UART1 must be used. Set its protocol to \"23\" and options to "
"\"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF 需要连接 UART 的 RX 和 TX，因此不能使用 RCIN 端口和引脚。需使用 "
"SERIAL1（UART2）、SERIAL2（UART4）或 SERIAL3（UART1），将其协议设置为 「23」，选项设置为 「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:66
#: 82e9b358860a4dac8782fd06f5dbdd1b
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to RCIN and automatically provides telemetry.  "
"Set :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 RCIN 并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:68
#: 4aa3360d07ee4157a1d1a77c2eec56eb
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:71
#: f940135711a3416d9cf1261e2ab4e898
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:73
#: 811bc919012146b6a82ce8c80abdb74f
msgid ""
"The Pixhawk4-Mini supports up to 11 PWM outputs. All 11 outputs support all "
"normal PWM output formats. All outputs except numbers 7 and 8 support DShot."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk4-Mini 最多支持 11 路 PWM 输出。所有 11 路输出均支持普通 PWM 输出格式。除第 7 和第 8 路外，所有输出均支持 "
"DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:77
#: ad67515e1b1d4165896ea634c4e42152
msgid ""
"The first 8 outputs are labelled \"MAIN OUT\" on the case. The next 3 "
"outputs are labelled CAP1 to CAP3 on the case. The CAP4 pin cannot be used "
"as a PWM output."
msgstr ""
"前 8 路输出在外壳上标注为 「MAIN OUT」。接下来的 3 路输出在外壳上标注为 CAP1 至 CAP3。CAP4 引脚不能用作 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:81
#: 7a4176456f9d4cd0875ea7bd62dc0282
msgid "The 11 PWM outputs are in 4 groups:"
msgstr "11 路 PWM 输出分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:83
#: 686068b2706d491a98dd8f7e97e05e54
msgid "PWM 1, 2, 3 and 4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、2、3 和 4 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:84
#: effe35cd89b846e9850022ca616f47ea
msgid "PWM 5 and 6 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5 和 6 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:85
#: 87523d16c4f949e5b7e17f45fab8ee26
msgid "PWM 7 and 8 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 7 和 8 在第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:86
#: 00f4dc663f3e4eacb8eaddf1c5f228d4
msgid "PWM 9, 10 and 11 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 9、10 和 11 在第 4 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:88
#: 9989b964024944a9a5087164f877273f
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出速率。如果某组中任一通道使用 DShot，则该组中所有通道都必须使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:93
#: 5d6a012139874e7d9633dd6875967969
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:95
#: 215f7f6f1be04efca786ace825e16356
msgid ""
"The board has a dedicated power monitor port with a 6 pin connector. The "
"correct battery setting parameters are dependent on the type of power module"
" which is connected."
msgstr "该板有专用的 6 针电源监测端口。正确的电池设置参数取决于所连接的电源模块类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:100
#: 8264fdea9a0e42c48b3c2727f7043760
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:102
#: a623781fa4da42b29e817c49eefcd2ce
msgid ""
"The Pixhawk4-Mini has a builtin IST8310 compass. Due to potential "
"interference the board is usually used with an external I2C compass as part "
"of a GPS/Compass combination."
msgstr "Pixhawk4-Mini 内置 IST8310 罗盘。由于可能存在干扰，该板通常与 GPS/罗盘组合中的外部 I2C 罗盘配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:107
#: e1ce467b8ae246da9ec6c0c463d72379
msgid "GPIOs"
msgstr "GPIO"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:109
#: f823be0e25f140dbacf9e95a5a785016
msgid ""
"The 11 PWM ports plus the CAP4 ports can be used as GPIOs (relays, buttons, "
"RPM etc). To use them you need to limit the number of these pins that is "
"used for PWM by setting the BRD_PWM_COUNT to a number less than 11. See "
":ref:`common-gpios` page for more information."
msgstr ""
"11 路 PWM 端口加上 CAP4 端口可用作 GPIO（继电器、按钮、转速计等）。使用时需通过将 BRD_PWM_COUNT 设置为小于 11 "
"的值来限制用于 PWM 的引脚数量。更多信息请参阅 :ref:`common-gpios` 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph4mini.rst:114
#: 11fd3b35f1b7451aba989c3b3878adfc
msgid ""
"For example if you set BRD_PWM_COUNT to 8 then CAP1, CAP2 and CAP3 will be "
"available for use as GPIOs, in addition to CAP4."
msgstr "例如，若将 BRD_PWM_COUNT 设置为 8，则 CAP1、CAP2 和 CAP3 以及 CAP4 均可用作 GPIO。"

